            "role": "override",
            "text": "Create a notebook attached to a Customer Analytics account. Use for persisting investigations, call notes, and other free-form context. Provide `title` and the note body as Markdown via `text_content` — the server converts it into a formatted notebook (headings `#` through `######`, bullet lists `-`, ordered lists `1.`, fenced code blocks, `**bold**`, `*italic*`, `` `code` ``, and `[label](url)` links). Pass `content` (ProseMirror JSON) only if you already have a structured document; the server converts it into the same markdown notebook format. In most cases leave it unset and write Markdown in `text_content`. The notebook is created with internal visibility so it does not appear in the global notebooks list.",
